// d3 — Breaking the "lethal trifecta".
//
// An agent that (1) reads private data, (2) sees untrusted content and
// (3) can talk to the outside world can be prompt-injected into leaking.
// Remove leg (3) *conditionally*: once this session has read a secret, the
// agent loses internet egress for the rest of the day.

@id("default_tools")
permit (principal, action in Drupe::Action::"CallTool", resource);

@id("no_egress_after_secret")
forbid (principal, action == Drupe::Action::"WebFetch", resource)
when temporal {
    formerly within 24h Drupe::Action::"ReadSecret"::request{ input.name: * }
};
